.github/COPILOT_INSTRUCTIONS.md

# Built release artifacts (uploaded to GitHub releases, never committed)
*.zip
*.tar.gz
SHA256SUMS

# ...but the Radware CA certificates MUST ship so customers can upload them to
# API Management. These are public CA certificates presented on every TLS
# handshake, not secrets. Step 1 Path A of the README instructs customers to
# upload the root and the intermediate individually, so all three must be
# tracked — omitting them produced release archives with an empty certs/
# directory in v1.3.0 through v1.3.2.
!certs/rdwr-ca-chain.pem
!certs/rdwr-root-ca.pem
!certs/rdwr-intermediate-ca.pem
!rdwr_ca_chain.pem

# Engineering-only assistant notes (never customer-facing)
CLAUDE.md
